00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:19.160
Oh yeah we've been on the road, y'all,

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:23.940
we've been traveling around, doing shows

00:00:24.926 --> 00:00:29.926
and lots of bunk, bus bunk
time for introspection.

