But I also had some really
good experiences that--

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.670
Oh well share those as well.
Changed my life

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.470
as well as the life of my children.

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:45.070
Yeah so we've been on
the road on tour and then

