00:00:57.467 --> 00:01:01.440
we are going back out on the road.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.672
Yes we gonna keep telling
you about when we're gonna be

00:01:03.672 --> 00:01:05.947
on the road and you
know what you should go

00:01:05.947 --> 00:01:08.750
on the internets and look
around at all the fun

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:12.020
