I think by a certain point in the tour,

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.320
we were eating dishes that
were just called cholesterol.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.153
Yes.

00:03:58.153 --> 00:04:03.153
Okay we got a big styrofoam clam shell.

