00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:38.300
The custard, the hamburger,
and the cheese curds.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.690
Milwaukee knows what they're
doing when it comes to eating.

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.626
