00:07:05.523 --> 00:07:07.293
I don't know if you know about the,

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.470
all the sides that are offered.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:13.780
Okay so in case you didn't
know, Cook Out is a fast food

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:17.290
hamburger place in the south that has,

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.050
what makes it unusual is not just the fact

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:22.650
