basically just a ridiculous,

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:28.280
there are no rules in the universe.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:32.399
They've thrown all rules of
what a side is to the side

00:07:32.399 --> 00:07:36.750
because I got, first of all
I didn't get a cheeseburger,

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:39.260
I got a barbecue sandwich
because I was like,

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.930
you know what, I've never
had the barbecue sandwich

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:41.933
from Cook Out.
I've never done that either.

00:07:41.933 --> 00:07:44.360
I've always gotten it from Smithfield's

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:45.970
and we had one meal left and I was like

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:47.870
I haven't had a barbecue sandwich yet.

00:07:48.748 --> 00:07:51.830
Locke and Shepherd had
never been to Cook Out.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.140
Dang.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:55.470
I already knew you were a horrible parent.

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:58.320
Could not remember the last
time they went to Cook Out.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.720
'Cause Locke would have
been a lot younger.

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:02.850
You hit him on the head every time

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:04.613
