00:08:04.613 --> 00:08:06.210
So I got a barbecue sandwich.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.043
Like Men In Black.

00:08:07.043 --> 00:08:09.390
And then the side that I got, of course,

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:11.396
one of the sides was a corn dog.

00:08:11.396 --> 00:08:13.240
Right.
Because that's a side.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.490
Nuggets can be a side, you get nuggets?

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.790
No, the other side was
a chicken quesadilla.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:23.130
But you just got three--
I just got three mains.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:26.090
But that's what makes it so crazy.

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:29.370
They got chicken quesadilla,
they actually have enchiladas

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:30.624
as sides too is what--

00:08:30.624 --> 00:08:32.150
