00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.100
Quesadilla?

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:34.490
The other one.
Enchilada?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.770
Yeah, it's not an inch, it's an ench.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.420
Enchilada.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.230
It's an E, not an I.
You can't be talking

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:44.220
to people about the way
to pronounce words, man.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:45.053
Enchilada.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.370
It's ehn-chilada if you wanna get--

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.326
You say inchilada.
Inchilada.

00:08:50.326 --> 00:08:52.114
Inchilada.
It's funny right.

00:08:52.114 --> 00:08:54.410
But go ahead, we know what you mean.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.500
Well then you should peench me

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:58.590
and tell me that I'm saying it wrong.

00:08:58.590 --> 00:08:59.677
I'll peench you.

00:09:00.602 --> 00:09:04.190
But I didn't get, where I drew the line is

