00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.147
watermelon shake that has
pieces of watermelon in it

00:09:14.147 --> 00:09:17.020
that's only served
between July and August.

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.520
It's great, it's crazy.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:21.473
It's crazy and so that--
And it's a small place.

00:09:21.473 --> 00:09:23.130
Have you ever looked through the window

