Like a cartoon.

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:31.460
Well I've seen multiple
people but there's only room

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.450
for one person.
I saw one girl.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.110
I saw one girl.

