00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:32.470
They had a thing called barbecue.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:35.040
It was made out of mushrooms.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:35.970
Where was this at?

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.340
Cafe Gratitude.

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:38.640
Oh, that place.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:39.500
We talked about this place

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:40.747
and when you order off the menu--

00:16:40.747 --> 00:16:41.630
I like that place.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:45.217
It's adjectives like whole and complete

00:16:45.217 --> 00:16:48.760
and serene and when you
order you're supposed to--

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:50.830
Whole with a W or just H-O-L-E?

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:52.820
Put this in your hole.

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.940
We're having a real--
Your mouth hole.

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:56.958
Homonym of an episode here aren't we?

00:16:56.958 --> 00:16:59.370
Well sometimes, man.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.460
You gotta clarify.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:01.810
There were no cops there.

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:06.240
It was, what was I saying again?

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:07.073
Whole.

00:17:07.073 --> 00:17:10.750
Oh, yeah, when you order
you say I am devoted.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:11.890
Yeah.
And then you get a dish

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:13.168
called devoted.
I have trouble.

00:17:13.168 --> 00:17:16.040
I have trouble with that
system but I appreciate it.

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:17.464
I did it.
I appreciate what

00:17:17.464 --> 00:17:18.893
it's trying to do.

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:22.250
Trying to give you gas.

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.090
And I'm not talkin' about--
And it's succeeding.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:27.993
It's not at the volume, it's the flavor.

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:31.620
It's the snet, snet, the scent.

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:34.700
All right I mean we got more to talk about

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.800
in terms of our tour so let's switch gears

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.503
to going back to the tour.

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:40.790
But first--
Bus gears.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.220
But first we wanna let you know

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:44.510
that you can grab these Ear Biscuits mugs.

