00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.030
Nobody sticks around.

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:35.730
But when you're driving
out of the parking lot,

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:36.563
you throw it in the trash can.

00:18:36.563 --> 00:18:37.990
I gotta go to the Corn Dog Castle

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:39.890
for that refuse bin.

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:41.865
Mythical.store.

00:18:41.865 --> 00:18:42.698
Get it.

